# Supabase Storage (S3-compatible) Configuration
# Get S3 credentials from Supabase Dashboard > Settings > API > S3 API
# See: https://supabase.com/docs/guides/storage/s3/authentication
# S3 endpoint for Supabase Storage (format: https://[project-ref].supabase.co/storage/v1/s3)
